WEBVTT

00:00:29.974 --> 00:00:33.694
AQShda 90 million kishilarda mavjud.

00:00:33.694 --> 00:00:36.567
Ammo qotgan va qirsillaydigan 
bo'g'imlar muqarrar holatmi?

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:38.781
Nima sababdan artrit 
ko'p uchraydiga kasallik

00:00:38.781 --> 00:00:42.619
va nima uchun haligacha bu keng 
tarqalgan kasallikga da'vo topmadik?

00:00:42.619 --> 00:00:45.538
Birinchi to'siq bu artritning

00:00:45.538 --> 00:00:48.949
yuzta turli hil holatlardan iboratligi.

00:00:48.949 --> 00:00:53.103
Bu barcha holatlarda bo'gimda og'riq hamda
yallig'lanish kuzatiladi.

00:00:53.103 --> 00:00:57.120
Ammo, bularni nima keltirishi hamda
simptomlar avjligi farqlanadi.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:59.812
Hattoki, eng tarqalgan turi osteoartritni

00:00:59.812 --> 00:01:02.217
oldini olish biz oylagandek oson emas.